    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm disappearing. i forgot my daughter's birthday yesterday. i didn't even realize i'd done it until she called. it's like my brain is just... leaking out of me bit by bit. i'm so scared of what's left when i'm finally just a shell.",
