      "content": "Hearing how deeply this fear weighs on you is heartbreaking, but taking immediate action about medical care is often the strongest step you can take rather than considering leaving. A skilled doctor can offer a thorough evaluation to help distinguish between temporary issues and other conditions, which might prevent unnecessary suffering. While waiting for an appointment, please lean on your support system for rides to the clinic or a distraction, as their care for you matters deeply.",
      "source": "target",
